# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Fire seen only through a carving: the pumpkin sprite has an OPAQUE near-black
# surround and a TRANSPARENT carving, so the full-layout fire beneath shows
# through the eyes and grin and nowhere else. The ramp keeps the fire DEEPER
# than the orange shell (dark red cavity, yellow-white licks) so the face reads,
# and its first stop is an ember, not black, so the carving never goes out.
# Authored for 64x64: the top-left 32x32 is the whole scene on a small panel
# (one pumpkin, one bat); a 64x64 adds a mirrored second pumpkin, two night
# quadrants with stars, and two more bats flapping out of phase.
S - Jack-o'-Lantern
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Fire
I @pat/perlin-fire
C sliderFlameHeightPct 6553600
R 100 0:2a0400 80:6a0c00 150:c02400 205:ff9a00 240:ffe08a 255:fff8e0
L color 32 0 32 32 normal 100 none fill 1
N Night
K 0a0508
L color 0 32 32 32 normal 100 none fill 1
N Night 2
K 0a0508
L pat 0 0 0 0 add 70 black fill 1
N Stars
I @pat/twinkle
C sliderDensity 196608
L sprite 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Pumpkin
I @spr/jack-o-lantern
L sprite 32 32 0 0 normal 100 none fill 3
N Pumpkin 2
I @spr/jack-o-lantern
L sprite 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Bat
I @spr/bat
L sprite 42 10 0 0 normal 100 none fill 3
N Bat 2
I @spr/bat
A 6
L sprite 8 44 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Bat 3
I @spr/bat
A 11
